# PRD: AI Room & Object Visualizer

## 1. Introduction / Overview

The **AI Room & Object Visualizer** is a lightweight, serverless web application that lets users preview how any physical object looks inside a real-world space before buying, moving, or staging it. A user uploads a photo of a background scene (such as a living room, office desk, kitchen counter, or patio), selects or uploads an image of **any object** (furniture, decor, plants, appliances, artwork, or everyday items), optionally adds a short placement instruction, selects how many variations to generate via a slider (default `2`), and receives photorealistic composite images in under 30 seconds.

By default, the AI automatically places the object in a contextually appropriate location with physically plausible scale, perspective, lighting direction, reflections, and contact shadows—no manual masking, 3D modeling, or photo editing required. This MVP is scoped as an unrestricted demo build (no login, no payment wall, and no usage limits) focused on speed, visual realism, and seamless desktop-to-mobile usability.

---

## 2. Goals

* **Fast end-to-end visualization:** Complete a full generation batch (default 2 variations) in **under 30 seconds** from clicking "Generate" to displaying results.
* **High physical realism by default:** Ensure generated images preserve the original room architecture and object identity while matching perspective, scale, ambient lighting, and contact shadows—even when no text prompt is provided.
* **Flexible object support:** Support **any** user-uploaded object image alongside a diverse built-in catalog of 8–10 sample objects across multiple categories (not limited to furniture).
* **Zero-friction demo experience:** Allow immediate usage on both desktop and mobile browsers without sign-up, account creation, or rate-limit blocks.
* **Controlled infrastructure cost:** Automatically compress oversized uploads before AI inference and auto-expire all temporary uploaded and generated images after 24 hours.
* **Reliable export:** Enable one-click high-resolution image downloads (PNG/JPG) on desktop and mobile browsers.

