## 5. Non-Goals (Out of Scope)

* **3D modeling, AR/VR, or CAD scaling:** No WebXR/AR camera overlays, 3D mesh reconstruction, or exact centimeter/inch dimension inputs.
* **Multi-object placement:** Users cannot place multiple objects (e.g., sofa + rug + lamp) in a single generation pass.
* **Manual in-app photo editing:** No cropping tools, color grading sliders, eraser brushes, or manual mask painting canvases.
* **User accounts & persistence:** No login, OAuth, user profiles, saved galleries, or project history beyond the active browser session and 24-hour temporary asset URLs.
* **Payments, credits, or rate limits:** No Stripe/billing integration, credit counters, or IP throttling in this MVP demo.
* **Video or 360-degree room tours:** Static 2D image inputs and static 2D image outputs only.

